; Exercise 1: draw the digit in V0 at the top left, wait for a key, and
; draw that key's digit beside it. V0 is set here, to 5, for the run;
; the program proper is the nine instructions from 202, 18 bytes.

6005    ; 200  V0 := 5              the digit given
6100    ; 202  V1 := 0              x
6200    ; 204  V2 := 0              y
F029    ; 206  I := the picture of digit V0
D125    ; 208  draw it: 5 rows at V1, V2
F30A    ; 20A  V3 := the next key, waiting for it
6105    ; 20C  V1 := 5              beside the first
F329    ; 20E  I := the picture of digit V3
D125    ; 210  draw it
1212    ; 212  the end
